/*And now we move on to Erina herself. Wingull and Chinchou resist different Water weaknesses (Grass for the former and Electric for the latter) and have pretty good coverage too. Pearlice the Cloyster is sorta like Misty's Starmie in that it's a fully-evolved Water Stone evo as an earlygame boss with a limited movepool. Here, Pearlice lacks any Ice moves whatsoever (a fact foreshadowed by Guide) and has sky-high defense, so the intended strat is to come in with a Grass or Electric type and hit her from the Special side, especially since the second half of Route 3 (after King Knight) has a Shock Wave TM. All three of her mons have Water Pulse, which she gives as a TM after you beat her. Keep in mind that all Badge TMs will be buyable in town after beating the associated boss.*/

