/*Now onto Route 4, which has the first post-intro Rival fight! Maple's mons will always have EVs accumulated from every trainer starting where she obtained them up to where she's currently being fought, because I like it like that. Terra the Eevee will become a Leafeon soon, so right now it uses physical attacks. Snowcone the Vanillite serves as her special attacker with good coverage (including Shock Wave from Route 3), and gets to stay safe from Fire due to Route 4 being in a state of perpetual rain. Artoria the Swablu has learned some new tricks as well, now packing dual STAB, evo STAB in Twister, and Water Pulse which was taken from the first Badge.*/

